<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistan's Fauji Fertilizer up 3.32 pct.</title>
<headline>Pakistan's Fauji Fertilizer up 3.32 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan's blue chip Fauji Fertilizer gained 2.20 rupees, or 3.32 percent, to 68.50 on Thursday on buying by local and foreign investors following a recent slide in the group's share price, dealers said.</p>
<p>Turnover of 866,500 shares in the company was recorded at mid-session.</p>
<p>&quot;The stocks had tumbled during the market's recent slide on institutional selling,&quot; dealer Ather Raouf said. &quot;But there has been fresh buying at the lower level both by local and foreign investors as the stock is good.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9251-5685192</p>
